<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: center"><B><FONT STYLE="text-transform: uppercase;">MicroCloud hologram inc</FONT></B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

